<title>BELGIUM: EU publishes durum wheat export tender details.</title>
<headline>EU publishes durum wheat export tender details.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has published an invitation to tender for the export of 100,000 tonnes of EU free market durum wheat to non-EU countries.</p>
<p>Details were given in regulation 2264/96 published in the EU Official Journal L 306 on Friday.</p>
</text>
